# ms178-1.patch (v10) - vkd3d-proton + dxil-spirv + dxbc-spirv optimization & bugfix patch
# Target baseline:
# - vkd3d-proton: 4522cc1a (v3.1+)
# - subprojects/dxil-spirv: 8b48f0e0
# - subprojects/dxil-spirv/subprojects/dxbc-spirv: 8dae2d85
#
# Key design & rebase notes:
# - Preserve bit-exact FNV-1a in hash_fnv1_* (persistent Steam Fossilize / shader-interface cache keys).
# - Use power-of-2 table probing + hardware SSE4.2 CRC32C only for transient in-memory hash_map / view_map / String hashes.
# - Add dedicated zero-indirection CopyDescriptors_embedded_64_16_packed vtable fast path for AMD RX Vega 64 (gfx900, RADV) & RDNA2.
# - Retain Cyberpunk2077.exe SMALL_VRAM_REBAR + ALLOW_SBT_COLLECTION app profile without forcing global 7 GiB ReBAR across all titles.
# - Every hot-path change is backed by llvm-mca (Raptor Lake) and native perf stat measurements; regressive rewrites were dropped.

